text:
When accessibility is enabled, it is possible to navigate through the device using 
gestures:
tap or tap and drag gesture moves focus onto tapped item;
double tap gesture opens or activates an item;
swipe right gesture moves the focus to the next item;
swipe left gesture moves focus to the previous item;
swipe up gesture moves focus to the next slider value (if applicable). 
Works on any part of the screen;
swipe down gesture moves focus to the previous slider value (if 
applicable). Works on any part of the screen;
double tap and hold gesture opens or exits the context menu. Works 
on any part of the screen;
